nt it within `helloworld/greeter_server`\r\n\r\nI am still unable to replicate the bug mentioned originally in the issue and test whether my changes on client-side will fix it. \r\n\r\ngrpc version: v1.58.2\r\ngo version: go1.20.4 darwin/arm64\r\nOS: macOS Ventura 13.4\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1485\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/assets/90945854/0d8e0058-9a0e-43c1-8f6a-a42b859505a3\">\r\n\r\nat packet 3773, I applied the rule to `pftcl`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nblock drop in on lo0 proto tcp from any to any port = 8080\r\n```\r\n\r\nbut my server does not reset the connection after a single lost keepalive packet (I am using the default keepalive settings on both client and server side).\r\n\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES: none","closed_by":{"login":"arvindbr8","id":16590502,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTkwNTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16590502?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8","html_url":"https://github.com/arvindbr8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arvindbr8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6672/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":